            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "A set of selected photographs of different protest signs used during the first wave of\nprotests (January–February, 2017). This set was constructed by collecting\nphotographs of protests from online archives assembled by local bloggers and\nnews media (e.g. <a href=\"<a href=\"https://www.lozinici.ro\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://www.lozinici.ro</a>/\"><a href=\"https://www.lozinici.ro\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://www.lozinici.ro</a></a>,\n<a href=\"<a href=\"http://www.ziare.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://http://www.ziare.com</a>/\"><a href=\"http://www.ziare.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://http://www.ziare.com</a></a>, and <a href=\"<a href=\"http://www.artofprotest.ro\" target=\"_blank\">https://http://www.artofprotest.ro</a>/\"><a href=\"http://www.artofprotest.ro\" target=\"_blank\">https://http://www.artofprotest.ro</a></a>) and from Instagram, by harvesting images posted with\none of the popular hashtags during these events (e.g. #altaintrebare,\n#coruptiaucide, #neamsaturat, #romaniatrezeste, #romaniainstrada)."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
